From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2026 11:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] compat: explicitly convert layer-shell texture pointer to bool

Forky's hyprutils marks CSharedPointer::operator bool() explicit. The
attached-buffer state is a bool and therefore requires an explicit conversion.

--- a/src/protocols/LayerShell.cpp
+++ b/src/protocols/LayerShell.cpp
@@ -44,7 +44,7 @@ CLayerSurface::CLayerSurface(SP<CZwlrLayerSurfaceV1> resource_, SP<CWLSurfaceRe
         m_current           = m_pending;
         m_pending.committed = 0;
 
-        bool attachedBuffer = m_surface->m_current.texture;
+        bool attachedBuffer = static_cast<bool>(m_surface->m_current.texture);
 
         if (attachedBuffer && !m_configured) {
             m_surface->error(-1, "layerSurface was not configured, but a buffer was attached");
